### Modulo tenancy — tenants, membros e convites.
### Requer @token e @tenant, obtidos em 00-auth.http.
@api = http://localhost:8000
@token = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ACCESS_TOKEN
@tenant = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_DO_TENANT

### Criar um tenant (nao envie x-tenant-id: ele ainda nao existe)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Industrias", "slug": "acme-industrias" }

### Listar os tenants em que sou membro
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver um tenant
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants/{{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Alterar nome e configuracoes (mescla, nao substitui)
PATCH {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants/{{tenant}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Industrias S.A.", "settings": { "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo" } }

### Suspender (escritas dos demais modulos passam a ser recusadas)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants/{{tenant}}/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Pagamento em atraso" }

### Reativar
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants/{{tenant}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Listar membros
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/members?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Convidar — o token do convite volta uma unica vez, nesta resposta
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bruno@acme.test", "role": "manager", "validForDays": 7 }

### Listar convites
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### Aceitar um convite (com o token de QUEM foi convidado, sem x-tenant-id)
POST {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/invitations/accept
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_DO_CONVIDADO
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "TOKEN_DO_CONVITE" }

### Trocar o papel de um membro
PATCH {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/members/UUID_DO_USUARIO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "viewer" }

### Remover um membro (o ultimo dono ativo nao pode ser removido)
DELETE {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/members/UUID_DO_USUARIO
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
